    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>++WISHLIST NOW++</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wired Coroner</i></strong> is a 3D pixel-style system-building roguelike, and also a narrative experience that questions technological alienation and the nature of identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7947243bcff1b857951e06262b7bde81.poster.avif?t=1747812001\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7947243bcff1b857951e06262b7bde81.webm?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7947243bcff1b857951e06262b7bde81.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this noir-cyberpunk game, you play as a fragment of a coroner\u2019s mind awakened inside a simulation. By assembling a <strong>\u201cCybernetic Autopsy System\u201d</strong> built out of retro techs and tangled wires, you investigate a murder\u2014your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wire up old electronics to create your own unique autopsy system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch them together as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/17c71e52876664f44980c8ab8b52db62.poster.avif?t=1747812001\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/17c71e52876664f44980c8ab8b52db62.webm?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/17c71e52876664f44980c8ab8b52db62.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack into suspicious electronic implants.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect to the body, insert the storage loaded with hacking program and initiate the implant intrusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether the system you've patched together works\u2014this is the moment of truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/63eba6063613468b22e1f272d0b1ec09.poster.avif?t=1747812001\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/63eba6063613468b22e1f272d0b1ec09.webm?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/63eba6063613468b22e1f272d0b1ec09.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep upgrading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your system with new gears. Optimize every intrusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7a60a963b1fe7bb905174f0dc5910ef1.poster.avif?t=1747812001\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7a60a963b1fe7bb905174f0dc5910ef1.webm?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7a60a963b1fe7bb905174f0dc5910ef1.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work in progress, not representative of the final quality. Stay tuned!</h2>",
