64f44980c8ab8b52db62.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack into suspicious electronic implants.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect to the body, insert the storage loaded with hacking program and initiate the implant intrusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether the system you've patched together works\u2014this is the moment of truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/63eba6063613468b22e1f272d0b1ec09.poster.avif?t=1747812001\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/63eba6063613468b22e1f272d0b1ec09.webm?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/63eba6063613468b22e1f272d0b1ec09.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep upgrading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your system with new gears. Optimize every intrusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7a60a963b1fe7bb905174f0dc5910ef1.poster.avif?t=1747812001\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7a60a963b1fe7bb905174f0dc5910ef1.webm?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716050/extras/7a60a963b1fe7bb905174f0dc5910ef1.mp4?t=1747812001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work in progress, not representative of the final quality. Stay tuned!</h2>",
    "short_description": "Wired Coroner is a Noir-cyberpunk Turn-based Roguelite. You are a coroner, already dead. Construct your own Cybernetic Autopsy System with wires and retro-tech, dive into cybernetic corpses to extract the truth behind your own murder\u2014After all, only the dead won't hide.",
